Z||000003||Monkeyman||09-22-2000||08:52 PM||||For what it's worth, all of the aero fascias are identical.  The only exception is the molding.  Ribbed for the '84 Indy, '85 GT and '86 (and '87?) SE and smooth (round) for the '86-'88 GTs.  If you find a spoiler that fits any aero fascia'd car, it'll fit 'em all. ||||reg||1
